# Applies to the STAGED build context (see build.sh). Keep the heavy/irrelevant out so the
# base venv warmed in Tier 0 is never clobbered and the context stays small.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/node_modules
# Repo working dirs / governed data never belong in an image (data lives in lamindb storage).
# NAMED PRECISELY, not `**/data`: since the re-layering BOTH objectives have a PACKAGE called
# `data` (roi_detection/src/{general,core}/data), and a bare `**/data` silently dropped the whole
# data layer out of the wheel the image builds.
**/runs
**/logs
**/*.sif
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/notebooks
**/.env
**/.test.env
